# =============================================================================
# 100-Tage Curriculum — .gitignore
# Covers: Rust, TypeScript/Node, C/C++, Zig, Python, Dart, WASM, infra
# =============================================================================

# --- Rust / Cargo ---
target/
**/target/
*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock            # keep this line OUT if you want lockfiles for bins;
                       # these are per-day binary crates, so uncomment to ignore
                       # → actually we COMMIT Cargo.lock for binaries (see below)
# Cargo.lock           # (left commented: we DO commit Cargo.lock for the day bins)
# If you add a workspace library, ignore its lockfile manually.

